      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thank you for your feedback!\n\nThis board is about the VRChat Creator Companion, our tool for creating Unity projects with our Avatars or Worlds SDK.\n\nFeel free to submit a feature request on the appropriate board. (As far as I know, the Oculus store has different guidelines than Steam. By the time Meta approves the beta, it might already be released publicly!)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
