  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-05T22:50:25.627Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I had tried to get SteamVR working on my Oculus Quest 2 for ages, but it refuses to recognize my headset no matter what I do. And yes, I have done it all and wasted tons of my life already following tutorials that lead nowhere. Recently, the Community Events meetup did not happen in the standard release of VR Chat, but the Beta version, which does not exist on the Oculus PC page. Any tutorials for accessing the Beta through the Oculus store are for standalone only.\n\nPlease support Beta on the Oculus Store. And if there is a platform unsupported, it would be good to mention that at the top of any troubleshooting lists.",
